   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-16): replaces the scope above.**\n\n- The Messages list (« Tous », « MP », « MP multiples ») shows **100 conversations per screen**: HFR pages 2k−1 and 2k of `cat=prive` merged into one list. The 50-per-page size is from captures R13u1 and R95k.\n- **Pager only at the bottom:** when the list is scrolled to its end, the page controls appear (as #898):\n  - ‹ and › in pills **without a solid fill**; only the arrow carries the accent, greyed when the move is impossible (same rule as #965);\n  - a **centred pill « page x / y »**, where y = ⌈last HFR page / 2⌉ (HFR's pager gives the last page).\n- **No overlap with the Liquid Glass tab bar** (Catégories, Favoris, Messages, Plus). The tab bar stays visible and may expand at the bottom of the list, so the pager sits **above** it, respecting its expanded height and the safe area.\n- Nowhere else: no pager while scrolling, no « Page N » title.\n- The MP **reader** is unchanged.\n\nTests:\n- the list model fetches HFR pages (2x−1, 2x) and merges them in order, without duplicates if a conversation moved between the two fetches;\n- y from the last HFR page;\n- the pager state appears only at the end;\n- the layout keeps the pager above the tab bar inset.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
   "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
