   "updated_at": "2026-11-16T22:40:07Z",
   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-16, second): amends the decision above.** Shared with #980 (category topic list), one pager component for both.\n\n- **Page size stays legacy's: one HFR page per screen** (50 rows, captures R13u1, R95k). The « 100 per screen » merge of pages 2k−1 / 2k is **dropped**: page x of the app = HFR page x of `cat=prive`.\n- **Pager only at the end of the list**, above the Liquid Glass tab bar (unchanged from above).\n- **Layout:** a pill « page x / y » **to the left of** the « ‹ » and « › » pills (not centred). Arrow pills without a solid fill, arrow in the accent colour, greyed when the move is impossible (#965 rule).\n- **Tap on « page x / y »** opens a menu: Première page, Précédente, Suivante, Dernière page, Aller à la page… (page entry, legacy `TopicPagePickerSheet`, `HFRswift/Swift/MainWindow.swift:923-930` @ `87fe0d1c`). Entries that cannot apply are disabled.\n- **No long press** on the arrows.\n- The MP reader is unchanged.\n\nTests to replace the ones above: the list model fetches exactly HFR page x; y is the last HFR page; the menu's first/previous/next/last targets and disabled states at the bounds; pager state only at the end; pager above the tab-bar inset.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
